3     

Query plan:
nl-join (left outer join)
    edge:  term[?]
    outer: sscan
               class: o node[?]
               cost:  ? card ?
    inner: sscan
               class: u node[?]
               sargs: term[?]
               cost:  ? card ?
    cost:  ? card ?
Query stmt:
select count(*) from ro o left outer join ru u on o.k= cast(u.code as double)+ cast(? as double)
